<title>NETHERLANDS: Getronics says 20 pct EPS growth possible.</title>
<headline>Getronics says 20 pct EPS growth possible.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics firm Getronics NV said on Friday it believed it could attain annual earnings per share growth of around 20 percent in coming years.</p>
</text>
